338	 * Insert the profile block as the first <project_instructions> block inside
339	 * <project_context>, leading cache-base-prompt's contiguous global run.
340	 * Returns the input unchanged when profile is already present (idempotent), or
341	 * `null` when there is no <project_context> to splice into.
342	 */
